Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.50,0:00:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好 酒保先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evening, barkeep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.29,0:00:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦给我来点儿含酒精的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would like to purchase some alcohol, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.58,0:00:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-huh. What can I get you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.26,0:00:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我的证件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm 26, as you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.62,0:00:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经26岁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}From my license.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.67,0:00:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝贺你 你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations. What can I get you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.35,0:00:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一杯香蕉代基里酒 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}A banana daiquiri, my good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.15,0:00:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫克丽丝多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.82,0:00:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.08,0:00:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 克丽丝多 我是加里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Crystal. I'm Gary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.29,0:00:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,加里 我本不想令你尴尬的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gary, I don't want to embarrass you,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.93,0:00:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你是个\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you are just …
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.58,0:00:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来真的太迷人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are just a stunning-looking man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.44,0:00:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.13,0:00:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh! Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.12,0:00:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,加里 你今晚玩得开心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Gary, you having a good time tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.38,0:00:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢关心 克丽丝多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm! Thank you for asking, Crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.52,0:01:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这简直是我过得最棒的一晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is, like, the best night ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.59,0:01:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说我们还能不能让它更棒一些呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think we could make it any better?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.96,0:01:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能吧 我也不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.24,0:01:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 你想出去走走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, do you want to get out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.49,0:01:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我挺喜欢这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I-I kind of like this bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.25,0:01:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才刚点了这杯代基里酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I just ordered this daiquiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.36,0:01:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是指\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.11,0:01:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想不想和我一起离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to get out of here with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.05,0:01:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这是在说性之类的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we talking about sex?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.23,0:01:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I, uh …
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.92,0:01:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I suppose we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.13,0:01:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,克丽丝多 我非常乐意跟你做爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crystal, I would love to have the sex with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.93,0:01:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.79,0:01:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.06,0:02:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 我喜欢你的夹克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love that jacket on you, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.71,0:02:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.04,0:02:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.33,0:02:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从里到外都是崭新的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole outfit is new.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.30,0:02:21.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（胡萨托尼克河 马萨诸塞州 36小时之前）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.35,0:02:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,温彻斯特兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean and Sammy winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.27,0:02:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们多久没见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how long has it been?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.57,0:02:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,六年级的夏天后就没见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The summer before 6th grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.89,0:02:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hmm. I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.40,0:02:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给自己列了个书单\N{\fnArial\fs30}You assigned yourself your own reading list.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.20,0:02:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确有那么回事 我差点忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. I forgot about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.02,0:02:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈是我们遇到的最好的保姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mom happens to be the best babysitter we ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.17,0:02:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时我还在洲际公路边上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, when I was a maid at the mayflower,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.51,0:02:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,五月花饭店做服务生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out on the interstate …
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.96,0:02:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,连要孩子的想法都还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long before you were even an idea …
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.45,0:02:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的父亲从镇上经过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their daddy used to pass through town.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.11,0:02:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这对孩子交给了我照顾\N{\fnArial\fs30}And leave the boys with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.50,0:02:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后自己就去 工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}While… he went off to…work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.58,0:02:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一次 他去了两个礼拜没回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}One time, he was gone for two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.11,0:02:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个礼拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two weeks?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.30,0:03:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他经常一瘸一拐地回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he'd always come limping back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.31,0:03:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他爱着你们 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He loved you boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.29,0:03:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他都是在忙什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know what he did all that time?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.63,0:03:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,小萨姆总是试图告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little sammy kept trying to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.95,0:03:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然啦 我没相信他说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, I didn't believe him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.00,0:03:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少最开始是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not at first, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.82,0:03:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯蒂 我们的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katie, our dad, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.94,0:03:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,碰巧是个驱魔专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happened to be an expert at getting rid of ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.02,0:03:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们也是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, so are we.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.29,0:03:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 这就是我叫他们来的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I called them, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.46,0:03:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们能帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.45,0:03:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你们碰到了个皮皮鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like you guys got yourself a poltergeist.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.61,0:03:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是从我们住进来一两个月之后开始的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Started a month or two after we moved in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.83,0:03:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,一开始只是些碰撞声和敲击声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, first I-it was, uh, just bumps and knocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.86,0:03:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有抓墙的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh, scratches on the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.16,0:03:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着它开始弄坏东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then it started breaking things.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.06,0:03:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来它就袭击了凯蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then it attacked Katie?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.11,0:03:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是两天前的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was two nights ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.99,0:03:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 他们看看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you show them, honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.18,0:03:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,「殁童」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Murdered Chylde"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.25,0:03:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katie…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.06,0:03:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,会好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's gonna be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.99,0:04:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.40,0:04:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们何不出去渡个假\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you guys take yourselves a little vacation,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.04,0:04:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里我们来处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh, we'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.52,0:04:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.29,0:04:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,双层培根汉堡 大份油煎辣奶酪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, bacon burger turbo, large chili-cheese fry,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.55,0:04:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,一杯健康沙拉摇摇乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, and a health quake salad shake?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.62,0:04:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.01,0:04:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不是我点的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, uh it's not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.53,0:04:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽情摇吧 小可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you shake it up, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.77,0:04:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 先不提皮皮鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, poltergeist aside,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.83,0:04:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐娜看起来美极了 你说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Donna looked pretty good, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.34,0:04:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 你别说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, don't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.46,0:04:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还在对我们的保姆有性趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've still got the hots for our babysitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.08,0:04:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.11,0:04:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,真奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.44,0:04:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是觉得她 你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying that she, you know, she …
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.76,0:05:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很能干\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's … she's doing good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.56,0:05:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论是对她的丈夫 还是对她的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, with her husband, her kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.13,0:05:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有那些恐怖的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole amityville thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.04,0:05:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,困扰着他们 表现得很勇敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}being thrown at them, and they're hanging tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.67,0:05:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.36,0:05:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否想过你也愿意过上像那样的生活呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever think that you'd want something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.60,0:05:16.92,Title,0,0,0,0,,老婆 孩子 看看《整九码》（喜剧）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wife, rugrats, the whole nine?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.29,0:05:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这些不会再属于我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I mean, not really my thing anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.26,0:05:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.14,0:05:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你查到什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.39,0:05:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, well, that house of theirs,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.60,0:05:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是栋老宅 非常老\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's old … really old.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.19,0:05:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,几百年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, hundreds of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.95,0:05:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且我查到了一个传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I found a legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.77,0:05:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,未被证实 但是还是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's unconfirmed, but still…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.46,0:05:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.14,0:05:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,据称 在十八世纪二十年代\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supposedly, In the 1720s,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.40,0:05:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,房子的拥有者叫以赛亚·皮克特\N{\fnArial\fs30}House was owned by a guy named Isaiah Pickett.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.59,0:05:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说记载\N{\fnArial\fs30}Legend has it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.45,0:05:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他施巫术把一个女人吊死在了后院\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hung a woman in his backyard for witchcraft …
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.76,0:05:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个叫玛吉·布里格斯的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A woman named Maggie Briggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.05,0:05:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么说是个凶灵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so an angry ghost witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.80,0:05:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算那是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.20,0:05:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,依然解释不了「殁童」的含义\N{\fnArial\fs30}That still doesn't explain what "Murderd Chylde" Means.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.08,0:05:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 或者那婊子被埋在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Or where the bitch is buried.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.53,0:05:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是说虽然路途遥远\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I mean, it's a long way back,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.07,0:05:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我可以试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I can see if I can find.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.99,0:06:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,能否在小镇的历史记录中找到些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}something in the town records.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.52,0:06:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,值得一试\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's worth a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.18,0:06:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,有收获吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, any luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.99,0:06:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bubkes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.20,0:06:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,连一个能证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't even find proof a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.27,0:06:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾有人叫玛吉的证据都没找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}named Maggie briggs existed,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.86,0:06:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,更别说她被埋在哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}much less where she was planted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.22,0:06:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 咱们至少能在这里喘口气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Well, we've got a minute to breathe here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.76,0:06:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,先处理一下眼前的事情吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's pick it up first thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.18,0:06:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 回见\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bet. See you in a few.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.67,0:06:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.50,0:06:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.63,0:07:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是柯林斯 在30号公路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, this is Collins out on route 30.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.78,0:07:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们找到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.84,0:07:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克尔先生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Frankel?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.55,0:07:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是加里·弗兰克尔先生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Gary Frankel?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.56,0:07:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.17,0:07:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的家人都急死了 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your family's worried sick about you, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.86,0:07:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的…我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My … my family?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.45,0:07:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…哥哥打电话给你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}My…brother called you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.18,0:07:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 先上车 别冻着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Get in before you freeze solid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.99,0:08:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.97,0:08:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 我 我们在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh, w-where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.77,0:08:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,到家了 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're home, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.35,0:08:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 长官 我不住这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}N-no, officer, I-I'm not staying here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.48,0:08:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,加里 上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gary! Oh, my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.61,0:08:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,加里 谢天谢地 加里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gary! Oh, god! Gary!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.62,0:08:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.43,0:08:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 好的 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Okay. Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.49,0:08:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.48,0:08:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这…这是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… w-what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.19,0:08:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你什么意思 - 女士 你是谁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you mean? - Lady, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.95,0:08:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,年轻人 你喝醉了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Young man are you drunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.43,0:08:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.85,0:08:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,加里 你喝醉了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gary, are you drunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.06,0:08:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,回答你父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Answer your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.21,0:08:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.19,0:08:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I …
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.97,0:09:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.90,0:09:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这他妈的是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.16,0:09:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他神志不清了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's out of his gourd.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.62,0:09:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,年轻人 你真让我惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Young man, I'm very surprised at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.42,0:09:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.84,0:09:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也同样惊讶啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.90,0:09:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 太酷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.52,0:09:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好有男人味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.01,0:09:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他娘的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.11,0:09:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.78,0:09:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们儿 你跑哪去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell you been, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.62,0:09:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都给你打了几个小时的电话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been trying to call you for hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.72,0:09:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去买了点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I picked up some food.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.35,0:09:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,双层培根汉堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bacon burger turbo,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.33,0:09:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,大份油煎辣奶酪 没错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}large chili-cheese fry, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.51,0:09:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 兄弟 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, man. Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.65,0:09:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我只是没注意时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I just … I lost track of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.94,0:09:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是成心让你生气的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't mean to freak you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.96,0:09:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.51,0:09:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道你干嘛用了那么久 但还是谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know why it took you two hours, but thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.11,0:10:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没准会想去外面路上吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're gonna want to eat that on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.67,0:10:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.76,0:10:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚女佣进来 看见了这堆东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}The maid came in, saw that,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.33,0:10:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在她们都被吓得够呛\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now they're all kind of freaking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.30,0:10:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会让女佣进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you let the maid in?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.30,0:10:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就这么进来了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.91,0:10:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.47,0:10:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去上个厕所 然后我们出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to hit the head, and then we'll take off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.95,0:10:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我在外面等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I-I'll be outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.75,0:10:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,能出发了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.49,0:10:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.91,0:10:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,能让我开吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, can I drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.60,0:11:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,太赞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this is so sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.91,0:11:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点开行吗 安德瑞蒂（赛车选手）\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to get the lead out, andretti? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.83,0:11:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是倒档\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.69,0:11:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,挂着倒档呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reverse!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.16,0:11:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还挂在倒档呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in reverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.26,0:11:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的真的很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am really, really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.45,0:11:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.59,0:11:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是迪恩 这是我第N个号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Dean's other other cell,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.67,0:11:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道怎么做了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you must know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.97,0:11:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我把咱俩的手机都了个遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I've called every phone we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.77,0:11:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 你在哪儿啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.39,0:11:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.64,0:12:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这听上去真的挺疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is gonna sound crazy …
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.35,0:12:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是很疯狂 不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}really crazy … but, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.28,0:12:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这身体不是我自己的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm in the wrong body.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.41,0:12:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要你帮帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could use a little help here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.59,0:12:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好像还有 哮喘\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I think I got asthma.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.87,0:12:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我回个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.56,0:12:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸运星汽车旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky Star Motel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.34,0:12:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 能帮我连线102房间吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, could you please connect me to the room 102?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.57,0:12:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,102房间吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Room 102?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.89,0:12:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 他们午夜就退房了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, man, those guys checked out middle of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.67,0:12:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 「他们」 不止一个人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait … "Guys"? Plural?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.21,0:12:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 一个穿皮革外套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah … one leather jacket,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.39,0:12:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个高得跟野人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}one Sasquatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.00,0:12:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They left.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.18,0:13:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底什么人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.91,0:13:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,小孩挺聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smart kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.20,0:13:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是个处男\N{\fnArial\fs30}Virgin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.17,0:13:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,欲求不满的处男\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frustrated virgin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.94,0:13:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,巫术啊 加里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witchcraft, huh, Gary?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.62,0:13:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个邪恶的小混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You little satanic bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.90,0:14:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,加里 吃早饭啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gary! Breakfast!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.54,0:14:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,少来烦我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.39,0:14:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,加里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gary!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.08,0:14:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道啦 来啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.76,0:14:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,加里 说说昨晚怎么回事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Gary, I'd like to know what happened last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.04,0:14:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我还想知道呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So would I. Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.30,0:14:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 你忘了自己的计划了么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what happened with the plan, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.02,0:14:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}The plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.81,0:14:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划包括 高考啊 麻省理工啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}S.A.T.S, M.I.T. … The plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.51,0:14:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想当工程师 你就得拿到全额奖学金\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to be an engineer, you need a full ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.01,0:14:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说说 花天酒地对你的计划有帮助么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, tell me, how does getting drunk fit with the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.40,0:14:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.08,0:14:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 伙计 恕我直言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, buddy, no offense,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.69,0:14:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过现在来讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}but at the moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.44,0:14:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你那什么计划一点兴趣都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could give a rat's ass about your plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.70,0:14:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.74,0:14:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 我最近是不是有点 喜怒无常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, h-have I seemed, uh, moody lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.48,0:14:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,沉默寡言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Withdrawn?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.47,0:14:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且对超自然的事着迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any … any occult fixations?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.27,0:14:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.49,0:15:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜猜 我的拉丁语超级赞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess … I'm amazing at Latin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.58,0:15:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确实很有语言天赋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have an ear for languages.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.12,0:15:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近邻居有没有丢宠物的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, any of the neighborhood pets go missing recently?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.08,0:15:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你嗑药了是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you smoking drugs?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.11,0:15:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱纳德 他才没嗑药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leonard. He is not smoking drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.66,0:15:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有没有见过我看一本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have any of you seen me w-w-with a book?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.73,0:15:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,很大 很古老 皮质封面\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'd be big and old, uh, leather-bound,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.78,0:15:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面也许还有奇奇怪怪的字\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe some strange writing on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.96,0:15:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者坦白说 我不想让你们看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or frankly, I'm probably hiding it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.99,0:15:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,加里 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gary, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.24,0:15:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.98,0:15:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对小麦蛋白过敏\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're allergic to wheat gluten.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.59,0:15:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,谷蛋白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gluten.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.78,0:15:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你可露出马脚了 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You've seriously sprung a leak. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.35,0:15:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是爸妈看见你那些又古老又诡异的书\N{\fnArial\fs30}If mom and dad ever found that creepy old book of yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.82,0:15:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那够你被禁足10年的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd be grounded for a decade.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.21,0:15:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你竟敢在早餐的时候提起这事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're bringing it up at breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.03,0:15:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说确实有本书了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So there is a book.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.53,0:15:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,雪梨 我把书藏哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sydney, where do I keep it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.22,0:16:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到底要去哪儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, where we going, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.56,0:16:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,去工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}To work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.06,0:16:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The case?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.40,0:16:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢对 案件 当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, right. Yeah … the case. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.46,0:16:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想从哪儿开始着手呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where, uh, do you want to start?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.76,0:16:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你查不到玛吉·布里格斯埋在哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, since you couldn't find where Maggie Briggs was buried,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.09,0:16:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们得来个墓地一日游\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we have to do an all-day tombstone roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.98,0:16:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,看能不能把她挖出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}to see if we can dig her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.56,0:16:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 是玛…玛吉·布里格斯吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. M-maggie Briggs?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.35,0:16:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说那个女巫玛吉·布里格斯吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, like … like, the witch Maggie Briggs?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.79,0:16:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.45,0:16:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在地下室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, she's in the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.81,0:16:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么 什么地下室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come again? W-what basement?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.86,0:16:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,在以赛亚·皮克特的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isaiah pickett's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.05,0:16:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,传言是他绞死了她 但其实不然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, there's this legend that he hung her, but he didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.01,0:16:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,真相是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The real truth is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.03,0:16:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怀了他的私生子\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that she was carrying his illegitimate child,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.16,0:16:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他杀了她然后把她埋在地下室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he killed her and then buried her in the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.74,0:16:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的「殁童」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her "Murderd Chylde."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.00,0:16:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以才会有那些刮痕\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would explain the scratches.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.16,0:16:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会知道这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.01,0:16:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是做尽了无数的研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I've done all kinds of research on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.85,0:16:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 昨天晚上做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you know… last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.74,0:16:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.66,0:16:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,干的不错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice work…I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.42,0:17:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 打开啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, man, turn it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.26,0:17:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.77,0:17:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,废话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.26,0:17:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 有人盗用了我的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean! Someone has stolen my body!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.66,0:17:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你边上的家伙不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy right next to you is not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.19,0:17:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的快查留言 操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check your friggin' voicemail. Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.65,0:17:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,加里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gary?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.60,0:17:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.36,0:17:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我是加里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm Gary. Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.06,0:17:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,加里很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gary's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.07,0:17:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们什么时候开始用\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're referring to ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.12,0:17:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三人称称呼自己了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the third person now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.39,0:17:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们听说了昨晚的事 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We heard about last night. What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.51,0:17:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝醉了 没什么大不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got drunk. No big thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.22,0:17:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 我储物柜几号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, uh, what's my locker number?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.36,0:17:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你酒还没醒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Are you … are you still drunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.30,0:17:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我看见你变成三个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah. I see, like, three of you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.61,0:17:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 我储物柜是几号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, so … so, what's my locker number?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.19,0:18:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不 加里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, Gary.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.35,0:18:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这本书可是相当糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a very, very bad book.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.27,0:19:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,大师在此 小婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master chief is in the house, bizatches!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.56,0:19:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.82,0:19:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.12,0:19:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,真他妈的见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'll be damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.22,0:19:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,柳苔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Willow moss.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.90,0:19:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.61,0:19:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该覆满女巫的坟墓吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, uh, supposed to grow over witches' graves, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.56,0:19:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.66,0:20:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着兄弟 我真的很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man, I'm really sorry about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.14,0:20:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.19,0:20:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.61,0:20:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.28,0:20:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快他妈的离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get the hell out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.94,0:20:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哇哇 我们还得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa. We still got to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.14,0:20:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧掉尸体 你这蠢材\N{\fnArial\fs30}burn the body, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.87,0:20:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.18,0:21:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.39,0:21:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一下真是太爽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.11,0:21:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 加里 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, gary, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.54,0:21:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.43,0:21:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got something to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.88,0:21:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要逃课吗你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're skipping class? You?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.55,0:21:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.28,0:21:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,身体不舒服 行了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}not feeling like myself, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.53,0:21:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 无论是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, whatever it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.24,0:21:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起谈谈 兄弟 一起吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can talk it out, bro. Come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.35,0:21:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没时间 得走了 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have time. I got to go. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.50,0:21:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,特雷弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trevor!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.34,0:21:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我还能怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what else was I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.85,0:21:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.98,0:21:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮个忙 甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do me a favor, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.98,0:21:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,能给我来个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you bring me a.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.29,0:21:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,加量培根的芝士堡吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}cheeseburger with extra bacon?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.81,0:22:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面再加个煎蛋 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And fry an egg on top of it, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.37,0:22:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.31,0:22:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 听起来很棒嘛 我也要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh, that … that sounds good. Ditto.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.22,0:22:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上送到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be right back with your order.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.45,0:22:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你到底是谁 你对萨姆做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, who are you and what have you done with sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.60,0:22:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-what do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.30,0:22:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在又变成培根芝士堡了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bacon cheeseburgers now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.32,0:22:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我难道不能吃吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I eat them, don't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.19,0:22:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎么说 我们可在庆祝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyways, we are celebrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.57,0:22:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.28,0:22:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有白费劲 今天好样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one bites the dust. Nice work today.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.58,0:22:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.05,0:22:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今天感觉真棒 兄弟 说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a, uh, really awesome day, man. Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.33,0:22:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.92,0:22:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得今天很棒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A really awesome day?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.06,0:22:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错啊 难道不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.33,0:22:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次猎捕根本毫无章法 糟糕透顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a random, d-list ghost hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.00,0:22:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,能算得上很棒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's… that's awesome to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.26,0:22:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道我就不能心情很好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't be in a good mood?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.89,0:22:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我想你应该不好 只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I guess. It's…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.30,0:22:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 完全可以心情好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.73,0:23:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过这不像是你的作风 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not really your style, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.27,0:23:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 那么 就当我脱胎换骨了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, it's a new me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.45,0:23:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 我为什么不该高兴点儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, come on. Why shouldn't I be happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.34,0:23:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有枪 现在还能喝酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a gun, I'm getting drunk,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.44,0:23:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我还非常喜欢目前的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I look like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.47,0:23:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.38,0:23:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你大概无法理解未来完全不由你做主的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever feel like your whole future is being decided for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.87,0:23:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 萨姆 我完全能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah, Sam, I feel like that a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.58,0:23:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论你这么反抗 都无法阻止计划发展\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter how much you fight it, you can't stop the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.08,0:23:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还是非常非常愚蠢的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stupid, stupid plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.29,0:23:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我弄不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.69,0:23:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就当它 不过是一时兴起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess it's, uh, it's just nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.18,0:23:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,换个够炫的口味 仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}to do a little ass-kicking for a change, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.64,0:23:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 我是喝醉了在说胡话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, you know what? I … I'm drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.68,0:23:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 当没听过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Just … just forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.56,0:23:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 没关系的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.03,0:23:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.20,0:23:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我举双手赞成你说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll drink to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.92,0:23:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧 我究竟是一个人喝醉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, you know, is it just me,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.81,0:24:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是咱哥俩真一起在喝酒呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}or are we actually drinking together?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.64,0:24:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不经常这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't do it that often, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.18,0:24:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 可以这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you could say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.77,0:24:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就该多出来喝喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we should.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.01,0:24:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可真好 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a good guy, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.77,0:24:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,老弟 你可真喝醉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, you are drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.96,0:24:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃的来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.00,0:24:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 慢慢享用\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - Enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.38,0:24:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有点儿 但我说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.64,0:24:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really are a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.05,0:24:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,真赞\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bread alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.69,0:24:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便一提 相当中意你身上这件夹克噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love that jacket on you, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.29,0:24:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢夸奖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.76,0:24:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.03,0:24:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这身行头里里外外都是新的哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole outfit is new.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.76,0:25:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去那啥了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.13,0:25:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这他妈的搞毛啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.91,0:25:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想叫就叫啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can scream all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.65,0:25:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫破嗓子也没人理你 我父母都出城了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one can hear you! My parents are out of town!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.26,0:25:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,加里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gary.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.98,0:25:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,小特 怎么啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}T. What up?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.23,0:25:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你人在哪儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.69,0:25:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在无法告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I can't really tell you right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.56,0:25:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 哥们 你绝对不会相信的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, man, you wouldn't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.83,0:25:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那么 迪恩在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well… well, where's Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.21,0:25:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,6号公路旁的四叶草旅店 干嘛问这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, the cloverleaf on route 6. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.89,0:25:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么 你还没杀了他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean you haven't killed him yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.90,0:25:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 等等 等一下 你说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Wait, wait, wait, wait. W-what do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.48,0:25:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要杀了迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.89,0:25:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 正在计划中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm…building up to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.76,0:26:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 加里 我们这边有点儿麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Gary, we got problems here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.37,0:26:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如说\N{\fnArial\fs30}For one…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.37,0:26:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我此刻眼前就立着你的躯体\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking at your body right now …
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.18,0:26:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,而里面却是另一个家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}with this other dude in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.43,0:26:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 真的 他已经去过你家\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Yeah, he's been in your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.14,0:26:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,还跟你父母打过照面\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's hanging out with your parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.66,0:26:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 先冷静一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, just…calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.96,0:26:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论他说什么 都没人相信他吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever he says, no one's gonna believe him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.52,0:26:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此看来 一切都在掌控之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, w-we're still good.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.85,0:26:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托你快动手杀了那混账家伙吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just hurry up and kill the son of a bitch already, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.05,0:26:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,别催我 我自有分寸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't rush me. I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.67,0:26:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你好自为之\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you better.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.69,0:26:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,先挂了噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.11,0:26:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 这有点儿超出我想象了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man. I am in way over my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.75,0:26:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看他八成搞不定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think he's gonna do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.90,0:26:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,别紧张 我们说得可是加里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just relax. This is Gary we're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.44,0:26:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这该死的究竟是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.91,0:26:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这么会知道迪恩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know who Dean is?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.51,0:26:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都知道迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody knows Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.49,0:26:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可是地狱的头号红人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's "Hell's most wanted."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.25,0:26:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.71,0:26:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.40,0:26:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些蠢货和恶魔对话了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you idiots been talking to demons?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.89,0:26:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 没错 的确如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, right. We're the idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.07,0:26:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还是孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.32,0:26:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们根本不清楚自己在搞些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea what you're messing with.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.64,0:27:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道迪恩的脑袋价值不菲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we know that there's a price on Dean's head,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.98,0:27:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们是来取其性命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're the ones that are gonna collect.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.74,0:27:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.93,0:27:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,大约一个月之前 我们来到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}About a month ago, we were down here …
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.77,0:27:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 诺拉 - 干什么 我们不能说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nora. What? - We're not allowed to talk about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.52,0:27:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来到这里 拿着那本书玩玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were down here, goofing around with that book.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.26,0:27:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时的确没有向暗黑之王祷告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, I wouldn't exactly call praying to our dark overlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.72,0:27:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是「玩玩」而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Goofing around."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.75,0:27:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,别打断我 特雷弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be a loser, Trev.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.13,0:27:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,别搅和 特雷弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Trev.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.57,0:27:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 突然间 灯光忽闪忽灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, all of a sudden, the lights flickered.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.22,0:27:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧接着加里进入了一种怪异的状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Gary went into this weird trance.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.65,0:27:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他紧闭双眼 拿起铅笔 画出了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}He closed his eyes, picked up a pencil, and drew this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.60,0:27:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这事为什么怪异吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know what's really weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.58,0:27:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,加里根本不会画画\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gary can't draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.81,0:27:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说听到头脑里有个声音告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he heard a voice in his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.36,0:27:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔正在悬赏追杀这个画上的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demons were putting out a bounty on this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.48,0:27:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,悬赏\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bounty?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.47,0:27:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,面向全国的女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, to, like, every witch or satanist.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.38,0:27:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者魔教徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Across the whole country.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.69,0:27:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,而加里 他要做的就是找到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Gary … Gary's the one who spotted you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.68,0:27:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,像电影「辣妈辣妹」里那种换身份的把戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the "Freaky Friday" Crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.28,0:27:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是书中的另一个咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another spell from the book.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.55,0:27:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是加里的主意 就像特洛伊木马那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gary's idea … go in trojan horse-style.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.42,0:28:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的确很聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's really smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.99,0:28:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实如此 要是他能说到做到就更好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is, if he has the bean bags to go through with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.43,0:28:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.34,0:28:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们犯了一个可怕的错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are making a terrible mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.48,0:28:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在说的是一场与恶魔的交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're talking about a demon deal …
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.36,0:28:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀掉一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.61,0:28:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是一场游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.91,0:28:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们正在走向绝路\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're crossing a line you won't come back from.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.66,0:28:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.94,0:28:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.32,0:28:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么 我 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. I-I…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.70,0:28:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺拉 别告诉我你真的相信这个蠢蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nora, don't tell me you're actually listening to this jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.64,0:28:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.36,0:28:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许\N{\fnArial\fs30}M-maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.08,0:28:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 或许他说的是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I mean, what if he has a point?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.50,0:28:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信 先是加里动摇 然后是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe this. First Gary, now you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.26,0:28:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是不-\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't …
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.78,0:28:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.33,0:28:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.80,0:28:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想把事情做完\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want something done right…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.47,0:28:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛 你想怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you're gonna …
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.03,0:28:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要自己去杀了迪恩 是吗 猛男\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna go kill Dean yourself, tough guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.70,0:28:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没这个必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.21,0:28:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以靠这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.27,0:29:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 别开玩笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}N-no. Y-you can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.94,0:29:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以从那些恶魔里叫一个过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm calling up one of these bad boys,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.11,0:29:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,摆平这一切 然后坐享其成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turning these punks over, and getting paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.60,0:29:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,钞票 钞票 爽歪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dolla, dolla bills, y'all!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.19,0:29:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为这绝不是个好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I really don't think that that's a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.51,0:29:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.16,0:29:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这个主意糟透了 - 没人问你的意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a very, very bad idea. - No one asked you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.30,0:30:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.22,0:30:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.76,0:30:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样做 我求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this. I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.79,0:30:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,特雷弗 我觉得他说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trevor, I think he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.54,0:30:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还想上瓦萨大学呢 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you want to get into Vassar, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.74,0:30:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.65,0:30:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.49,0:30:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会把我们都害死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna get us all killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.77,0:30:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.33,0:30:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.55,0:30:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道我念错咒语了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I said it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.28,0:30:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nora?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.92,0:30:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 别碰她\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No, no! Don't touch her!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.32,0:30:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺拉 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nora, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.61,0:30:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.46,0:30:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm peachy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.20,0:30:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你叫我出来干嘛 小淘气\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what'd you call me here for, skippy?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.87,0:30:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.63,0:30:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,到晚餐时间了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's dinnertime?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.53,0:30:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 我 不是-\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I-I … n-no.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.45,0:31:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到迪恩·温彻斯特了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, we have Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.46,0:31:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.36,0:31:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.71,0:31:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,特雷弗 闭紧你的嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trevor, keep your mouth shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.71,0:31:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,在六号公路的四叶草旅店\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cloverleaf motel over on route 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.12,0:31:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.29,0:31:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你在那里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that you in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.62,0:31:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是一个98磅重的傻子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, aren't you just 98 pounds of nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.31,0:31:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个孩子是个白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kid is a moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.70,0:31:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不知道迪恩在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't have any idea where Dean is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.11,0:31:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 若是山姆在这个身体里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if Sam's in this body,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.56,0:31:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那谁在山姆的身体里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's in Sam's?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.76,0:31:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个危险的巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}A dangerous warlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.22,0:31:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫加里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Named Gary.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.83,0:31:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说你找到了迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean to tell me you've got Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.30,0:31:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,和萨姆·温彻斯特的肉身吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Sam Winchester's meat suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.19,0:32:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个空空的皮囊 等着有人来接管\N{\fnArial\fs30}An empty vessel just waiting to be filled.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.77,0:32:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是要把这两个人都献给我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're handing them both over to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.47,0:32:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 我想是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, y-yeah. I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.46,0:32:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.70,0:32:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要祝贺你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to hand it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.08,0:32:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真是深受感动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.80,0:32:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.04,0:32:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我冒昧的问一句\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if you don't mind my asking…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.43,0:32:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,有报酬吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a reward?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.68,0:32:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.34,0:32:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你表示无尽感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}My…undying gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.99,0:32:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你当真\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.07,0:32:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静点 你个傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be quiet, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.80,0:32:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,暗自庆信吧 小鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consider yourself lucky, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.78,0:32:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, w-wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.81,0:32:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这里累死累活\N{\fnArial\fs30}We worked our asses off here,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.74,0:32:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要我的报酬\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh, I want my reward!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.01,0:33:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.10,0:33:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.11,0:33:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.40,0:33:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.58,0:33:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以给你什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I get you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.35,0:33:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,100万美元怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, h-how about a million bucks?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.01,0:33:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 特雷弗 闭嘴快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, for god's sake, Trevor, just shut up and run!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.72,0:33:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在100万可不值钱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A million doesn't buy you much these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.25,0:33:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,1000万怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not make it 10?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.24,0:33:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 那就1000万\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, $10 mill.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.28,0:33:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还想\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I want…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.86,0:33:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,让明蒂·施瓦兹爱上我\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I want Mindy Schwartz to fall in love with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.05,0:33:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱情 金钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love…money.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.80,0:33:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类最基本的需求\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sticking to the basics.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.28,0:33:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can respect that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.50,0:33:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这是我付报酬的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}But here's my counter.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.94,0:34:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.36,0:34:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝起来是像白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tastes like moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.66,0:34:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有38条留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have 38 messages.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.39,0:34:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这听起来很疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is gonna sound crazy …
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.26,0:34:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是疯狂 但是我觉得我上错身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}really crazy … but, um, I think I'm in the wrong body.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.59,0:34:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你边上的家伙不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, the guy right next to you is not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.72,0:34:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 他妈的快查留言 操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, check your friggin' voicemail. Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.30,0:34:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.91,0:34:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你快老实交代 不然我可动私刑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either you start talking or I start waterboarding.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.69,0:34:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷 别伤害我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god. Please, don't hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.35,0:34:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 我很抱歉 真的很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! I'm sorry! I'm so, so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.75,0:34:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 别装死 装逼男\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Hey, pull it together, champ.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.90,0:34:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想死 真的不想死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to die. I don't want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.59,0:34:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.64,0:34:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我朋友的地窖里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my … my friend's basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.78,0:34:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的父母离开镇上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His parents are out of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.67,0:34:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.02,0:34:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你多大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.52,0:34:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,17岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}17.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.08,0:34:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,17岁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}17?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.53,0:35:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nora?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.27,0:35:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在可不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.45,0:35:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,真见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.24,0:35:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,小可爱 今晚该给你点儿小奖励\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, you earned your dessert tonight, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.48,0:35:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me … what is it you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.09,0:35:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都可以满足你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.02,0:35:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都可以吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.39,0:35:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管提吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lay it on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.39,0:35:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想成为一位巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to be a witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.13,0:35:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}For real.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.65,0:35:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常强大的巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}And really powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.89,0:36:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,选得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm. Good choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.21,0:36:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.28,0:36:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也不会有老爸烦着你考什么麻省理工\N{\fnArial\fs30}No daddy, no M.I.T.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.43,0:36:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没有人再为你设定好未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.43,0:36:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将变得高大而强壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get to be big and strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.19,0:36:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,别人再也不能对你指手画脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no one can tell you what to do anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.54,0:36:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但先得有个小小的礼节程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's just one small formality first.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.82,0:36:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得见见我们的老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to meet the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.36,0:36:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.53,0:36:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道啊 伟大的撒旦陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know … your satanic majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.91,0:36:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,当今的小孩子对他还有很多其他称呼呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}or whatever the kids are calling it these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.19,0:36:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个魔鬼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The devil?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.53,0:36:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…no.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.37,0:36:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}O-okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.07,0:36:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.82,0:36:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的不想惊动他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…don't really want to bother him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.73,0:36:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他想见见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, but he's gonna want to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.07,0:36:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,放轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.20,0:36:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.06,0:36:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是问你个小小的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just gonna ask you one little question,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.76,0:36:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要回答「是」就可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all you got to do is say "Yes."
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.60,0:37:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后呢 你就能得到你想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then… you get your reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.60,0:37:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.48,0:37:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.20,0:37:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, n-nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.75,0:37:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是想驱逐我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you trying to exorcise me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.15,0:37:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这臭小鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You little piece of crap?!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.86,0:37:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.73,0:37:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.34,0:37:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.26,0:37:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.84,0:37:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.97,0:37:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.19,0:37:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.70,0:37:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Adios 拜拜了 贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adios, bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.47,0:37:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 应该是Audi nos\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, it's "Audi nos."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.90,0:38:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.57,0:38:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.12,0:38:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.90,0:38:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,正常了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we good?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.05,0:38:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于正常了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. We're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.36,0:38:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 回归真身的感觉真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man, it's nice to be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.64,0:38:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 很爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.05,0:39:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.07,0:39:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,加里啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gary…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.91,0:39:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 是我不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I know … my bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.08,0:39:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,「是我不好」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"My bad"?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.45,0:39:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,小鬼 这样轻描淡写可不成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid, "My bad" ain't gonna cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.70,0:39:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道 如果你是成年人\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, if you were of voting age…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.13,0:39:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.68,0:39:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们会宰了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we would kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.96,0:39:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你老老实实的再也不碰这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}So either you straighten up and fly right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.92,0:39:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我们非宰了你不可\N{\fnArial\fs30}or we will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.73,0:39:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.33,0:39:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一清二楚 - 这还差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Crystal. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.73,0:39:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,真讨厌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.95,0:39:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 加里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gary, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.73,0:39:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,听听过来人的建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it from someone who knows …
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.21,0:39:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,别气馁啊 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chin up, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.40,0:39:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的生活其实并没有很糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your life ain't that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.96,0:39:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见过我父母了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, you met my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.06,0:39:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 那又怎样 这是你的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. So what? It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.93,0:40:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不喜欢他们对你指手画脚 就说出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't like their plan for you, tell them to cram it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.30,0:40:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,反抗一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rebel a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.57,0:40:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 用正常的方式 不要搞邪门歪道\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a healthy, non-satanic way, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.77,0:40:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便 你知道诺拉为何喜欢巫术吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, you know why Nora's into witchcraft?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.41,0:40:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.10,0:40:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不是喜欢撒旦\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't like satan,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.36,0:40:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这笨蛋 她喜欢的是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}you moron. She likes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.37,0:40:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.22,0:40:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样觉得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You … you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.29,0:40:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我能看出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.27,0:40:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you, kid …
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.87,0:40:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真希望自己是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I had your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.15,0:40:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.48,0:40:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.62,0:40:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.14,0:40:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是体贴啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a nice thing to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.15,0:40:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我根本是在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I totally lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.40,0:40:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那孩子的生活烂透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That kid's life sucked ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.66,0:41:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些苹果派和家人的唠叨 超压抑\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that apple-pie, family crap? It's stressful.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.38,0:41:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,信我没错 我们才不会想要那种生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me … we didn't miss a damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.18,0:41:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们根本不了解那种生活吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or we don't know what we're missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.17,0:41:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 老哥 小点声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come on, man. Turn it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.08,0:41:26.64,Title,0,0,0,0,,欢迎归来 《科特》（儿童情景喜剧）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back, Kotter.
